  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Administrative expenses related to participation at OECD DAC meeting on SK ODA peer-review</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Administrat&#xed;vne n&#xe1;klady spojen&#xe9; so zasadnut&#xed;m DAC OECD k peer-review SK ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Administrative costs related to participation of the Slovak Ministry of Finance&apos; representatives at the DAC OECD meeting devoted to results and recommendations of the first peer-review od the Slovak development cooperation system.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Administrat&#xed;vne n&#xe1;klady s&#xfa;visiace s &#xfa;&#x10d;as&#x165;ou z&#xe1;stupk&#xfd;&#x148; MF SR na tzv. hodnotiacom zasadnut&#xed; V&#xfd;boru OECD pre rozvojov&#xfa; spolupr&#xe1;cu k v&#xfd;stupom a odpor&#xfa;&#x10d;aniam historicky prv&#xe9;ho peer-review syst&#xe9;mu slovenskej rozvojovej spolupr&#xe1;ce.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
